config WS73_CORE
	tristate
	select FW_LOADER
	select CRYPTO_LIB_SHA256
	help
	  Shared WS73 protocol helpers used by actual function consumers.
	  This component validates HCC records, chip replies and original
	  firmware, and provides bounded boot transaction sequencing.
	  It has no Bluetooth or Wi-Fi stack dependency and does not yet
	  register a USB driver, transfer to hardware or enable a function.

config WS73_KUNIT_TEST
	tristate "WS73 firmware and boot transaction tests" if !KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	depends on KUNIT
	select WS73_CORE
	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	help
	  Validate original firmware profiles and download transactions.
	  Run production hashing and chunk sequencing with synthetic data
	  and an injectable synchronous transport. No USB device is used.
	  Success does not establish boot identity or firmware execution.
